Please note that this code is intended for demonstration purposes only and lacks many features required for a full-featured logging system, such as filtering duplicates, rate limiting, network communication, caching, error handling, and monitoring. Additionally, the code does not include multi-threaded safety in the append function or leader election/synchronization mechanisms for distributed environments. These features would need to be added based on the specific requirements and constraints of the system being developed.']

